{"id":466,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"ひと創りを軸に個性と知性を伸ばす甲南中","feature_description":"甲南中学校は「ひと創り」を教育の中心に置き、人格の修養と健康の増進を重視しています。知識に偏る画一的な教育を避け、徳・体・知のバランスを図りながら、一人ひとりの個性や才能を伸ばす方針です。勉学だけでなく心身の成長も教育に位置づけ、社会で活躍する人物の育成を目指す理念を現在も受け継いでいます。学びと身体づくりを通じた成長を重視します。","clubs":[{"id":14186,"name":"中学野球","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.konan.ed.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14187,"name":"卓球","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.konan.ed.jp/schoollife/club/table_tennis.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14188,"name":"テニス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.konan.ed.jp/schoollife/club/tennis.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14189,"name":"ラグビー","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.konan.ed.jp/schoollife/club/rugby.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14190,"name":"バスケットボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.konan.ed.jp/schoollife/club/basketball.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14191,"name":"ゴルフ","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.konan.ed.jp/news/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14192,"name":"アーチェリー","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.konan.ed.jp/schoollife/club/archery.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"}],"profile_sources":[{"id":3258,"attribute_key":"feature_summary","source_url":"https://www.konan.ed.jp/outline/rinen.html","source_kind":"official_site","external_school_code":null,"verified_at":"2026-11-16","source_excerpt":null,"fetched_at":null,"content_hash":null,"invalidated_at":null,"priority":null},{"id":3259,"attribute_key":"feature_description","source_url":"https://www.konan.ed.jp/outline/rinen.html","source_kind":"official_site","external_school_code":null,"verified_at":"2026-11-16","source_excerpt":null,"fetched_at":null,"content_hash":null,"invalidated_at":null,"priority":null},{"id":3767,"attribute_key":"lunch_type","source_url":"https://www.konan.ed.jp/schoollife/dailyschedule.html","source_kind":"official_sit